ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260920/202609202321128235_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260920/202609202321128235_720.jpg"> </div><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-21/match2075464date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">赫伊森送红点！十人皇马1-2马竞跌第3 小西蒙尼造点+助攻戴维破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260921/zhanbao_image_2075464_1789920668_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260921/zhanbao_image_2075464_1789920668_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260921/zhanbao_image_2075464_1789920668_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>马竞主场2-1战胜十人皇马，马竞取得联赛3连胜，积16分反超皇马升至第2，皇马遭遇赛季第2败，积15分下滑至第3。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-21/match2067690date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">各赛事5场仅1胜！曼联1-1富勒姆 利桑德罗乌龙库尼亚89分钟绝平</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.65" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260921/zhanbao_image_2067690_1789924840_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.65" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.65" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260921/zhanbao_image_2067690_1789924840_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260921/zhanbao_image_2067690_1789924840_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>曼联客场1-1战平富勒姆，各项赛事近5场仅1胜。比赛中，利桑德罗乌龙，库尼亚89分钟绝平。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-20/match2067692date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进球大战！曼城5-3桑德兰3分领跑 塞梅尼奥2射1传布罗比戴帽</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.57" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260920/zhanbao_image_2067692_1789916440_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.57" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.57" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260920/zhanbao_image_2067692_1789916440_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260920/zhanbao_image_2067692_1789916440_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>曼城5-3击败桑德兰，英超前五轮全胜3分领跑。桑德兰方面布罗比戴帽，曼城方面塞梅尼奥双响，哈兰德、谢尔基和恩佐破门。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-20/match2067686date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">5轮不败！利物浦1-0伯恩茅斯 加克波策动伊萨克制胜 伊劳拉胜旧主</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.65" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260920/zhanbao_image_2067686_1789915871_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.65" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.65" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260920/zhanbao_image_2067686_1789915871_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260920/zhanbao_image_2067686_1789915871_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>利物浦1-0伯恩茅斯，伊萨克制胜球，加克波策动进球。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-21/match2057432date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">近3轮首胜！米兰3-0莱切 普利西奇破荒拉比奥建功莫雷拉替补破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.61" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260921/zhanbao_image_2057432_1789936794_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.61" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.61" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260921/zhanbao_image_2057432_1789936794_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260921/zhanbao_image_2057432_1789936794_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>米兰3-0莱切。积分榜方面，米兰近三轮首胜积11分暂第五，莱切6分第十二。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-21/match2057424date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">近3轮首胜！尤文2-0亚特兰大暂升第6 孔塞桑破门布雷默建功</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260921/zhanbao_image_2057424_1789926975_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260921/zhanbao_image_2057424_1789926975_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260921/zhanbao_image_2057424_1789926975_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>尤文2-0击败亚特兰大，取得近3轮意甲首胜。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-21/match2059520date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">三连胜！巴黎2-1送马赛五连败 费兰马尔基尼奥斯建功登贝莱失空门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260921/zhanbao_image_2059520_1789936529_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260921/zhanbao_image_2059520_1789936529_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260921/zhanbao_image_2059520_1789936529_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>巴黎以2-1击败马赛，各项赛事达成三连胜的同时送给对手五连败。积分榜方面，马赛积3分排在第17位，巴黎圣日耳曼积8分排在第6位。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-20/match2067691date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">开赛5轮不败！利兹联0-0水晶宫 米切尔进球被吹 水晶宫5轮仅1胜</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.76" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260920/zhanbao_image_2067691_1789915439_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.76" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.76" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260920/zhanbao_image_2067691_1789915439_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260920/zhanbao_image_2067691_1789915439_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>利兹联0-0战平水晶宫，开赛5轮保持不败；水晶宫5轮仅1胜。</p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-21/6ab011e2e1200native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">火力全开!穆帅3000字赛后：漏判2红|裁委会很开心|西甲还是一样黑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8"